</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">Per day, per project</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">200 billion</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><strong style="vertical-align:baseline">AI input tokens per day per user</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">Input tokens used by the LLM</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">Per day, per project, per user</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">150 billion</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><strong style="vertical-align:baseline">AI output tokens per day</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">Output and thinking tokens used by the LLM</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">Per day, per project, per project</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">20 billion</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><strong style="vertical-align:baseline">AI output tokens per day per user</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">Output and thinking tokens used by the LLM</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
<p><span style="vertical-align:baseline">Per day, per project, per user</span></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #000000;padding:16px">
